&chapter#p2c3{3.}{Unwritten}

&placeholder#the-argument{paragraphs}{m}{The argument}{She confronts him. He deflects. Three beats, escalating.}
The morning after, nobody spoke of it.

She bought the ticket without admitting why. &placeholder#reunion{sentences}{l}{Reunion beat}{They finally meet. Keep it wordless.} The stationmaster remembered him.

